package dnssec

import "core:testing"

/*
A covering NSEC whose next name lies below the question shows the question is an
empty non-terminal, a name that exists (RFC 4592 section 2.2.2, RFC 7129 section
5.4). The same record proves neither a name error for it (RFC 4035 section
3.1.3) nor that a wildcard above it could answer for a name below it.

Generated - `testdata/gen/sign_fixtures.py`, scenario
`empty_non_terminal_denials`.
*/

